  "prefLabel": "Inst 101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 101.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the procedures under which the board shall operate in implementing its statutory responsibilities created by RSA 205-D\n\nSource. #8492, eff 12-24-05",
